# Semantic tokens from the grammar's `color` lines: functions, parameters,
# constants (`readonly`), `var`s (LSP's `variable`), types (a constant
# whose value is a container or an error set), a struct's fields (LSP's
# `property`), an enum's fields, error names, enum literals and error
# values, each with `declaration` where it is defined, and each name and
# member of them (`p.sum`, `p.x`) as its definition. With the server the
# hooks.zig `--editor` writes, on project/colors.zig.
initialize quiet
open colors.zig
tokens colors.zig
